&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sc-kWREmZ gtHHTF&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sc-fxtexz gAAGsB&quot;&gt;As a Commercial Account Executive, you will play a critical role in expanding Miro’s footprint by landing net new customers and driving expansion within the 500-3,000 employee segment. This role is designed for sales professionals who excel in a fast-paced, high-volume sales environment and have a passion for helping smaller, dynamic companies unlock their potential with Miro. You will be responsible for managing the full sales cycle. While you will receive assistance from cross-functional partners, you will also take ownership of developing and advancing your pipeline.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prospect and Engage:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Leverage outbound strategies and tools like Salesforce, Outreach, and Gong to identify and connect with high-potential prospects in your territory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pipeline Management:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Build and maintain a high-volume pipeline of opportunities, ensuring consistent deal flow and efficient sales cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Value Selling:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Understand customer needs and challenges, demonstrating how Miro’s platform addresses their specific use cases and delivers measurable business value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Relationships:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Develop trust and credibility with key stakeholders, including senior decision-makers, within prospective organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Drive deals to close efficiently by managing high-velocity sales cycles while maintaining exceptional attention to detail and customer engagement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Work closely with Marketing, Customer success, and Sales Engineering to ensure alignment and optimize customer expansion efforts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market Intelligence:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Stay informed about industry trends, competitive offerings, and advancements in SaaS to position Miro as the solution of choice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
