&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;2+ years in a SaaS or technology sales environment, with experience in either a full-cycle closing role or a sales development background&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Strong prospecting abilities, effective communication skills, and proficiency in value-based selling techniques&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tools:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Familiarity with CRM platforms like Salesforce and sales engagement tools such as Outreach and Gong&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;A results-driven, entrepreneurial mindset with the ability to thrive in a dynamic, fast-moving environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptability:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Experience managing shorter sales cycles and high transaction volumes, with the ability to balance multiple priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;A team player who enjoys working cross-functionally to drive success&lt;/li&gt;
