&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Miro handles and uses personal data of job applicants in line with its &lt;a href=&quot;https://miro.com/legal/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt; found &lt;a href=&quot;https://miro.com/legal/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;miro-copy-source--rte&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re always excited to connect with strong talent for this team. While this Expression of Interest pipeline is focused on future opportunities, some related openings may also be live today.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;re looking to make a move immediately, we encourage you to check our careers page for currently open roles that match your background.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By applying here, you&#39;re joining our talent community for this specific team. Here is exactly how we handle these applications:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We look at every profile: &lt;/strong&gt;Our recruiting team reviews these regularly. If your background aligns with the skills we know we&#39;ll need next, we&#39;ll flag your profile.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We start with a casual chat: &lt;/strong&gt;If there&#39;s a potential future match, a recruiter will reach out for an introductory conversation. No intense interview loops—just a chance to connect on your career goals and what we&#39;re building.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We respect your time: &lt;/strong&gt;We won&#39;t kick off a formal, multi-stage interview process until a role is officially open and approved.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We keep you in mind: &lt;/strong&gt;Even if we don&#39;t reach out right away, we keep this talent pool active and turn to it first when a new headcount opens up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;miro-copy-source--rte&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;miro-copy-source--rte&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;miro-copy-source--rte&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Enterprise and Strategic teams sit at the center of Miro&#39;s evolution from a collaboration product to an AI-powered innovation workspace. Enterprise AEs work with large, complex organisations from 3,000 to 15,000 employees that are rethinking how their teams collaborate, innovate, and bring products to market. Strategic AEs own a focused portfolio of Miro&#39;s largest global accounts — Fortune 500 and Global 2000 enterprises — where the mission is to make Miro the nerve center for innovation across entire organisations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deals at both levels are multi-threaded, multi-stakeholder, and often multi-year. You&#39;ll work in tightly coordinated PODs alongside Solution Engineering, Customer Success, Value Advisory, Professional Services, and executive leadership. If you operate best when you&#39;re building long-term relationships, navigating complexity, and winning deals that genuinely transform how companies work — this is your team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sc-kWREmZ gtHHTF&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sc-fxtexz gAAGsB&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;miro-copy-source--rte&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;miro-copy-source--rte&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;miro-copy-source--rte&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Enterprise and Strategic teams sit at the center of Miro&#39;s evolution from a collaboration product to an AI-powered innovation workspace. Enterprise AEs work with large, complex organisations from 3,000 to 15,000 employees that are rethinking how their teams collaborate, innovate, and bring products to market. Strategic AEs own a focused portfolio of Miro&#39;s largest global accounts — Fortune 500 and Global 2000 enterprises — where the mission is to make Miro the nerve center for innovation across entire organisations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deals at both levels are multi-threaded, multi-stakeholder, and often multi-year. You&#39;ll work in tightly coordinated PODs alongside Solution Engineering, Customer Success, Value Advisory, Professional Services, and executive leadership. If you operate best when you&#39;re building long-term relationships, navigating complexity, and winning deals that genuinely transform how companies work — this is your team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;miro-copy-source--rte&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;miro-copy-source--rte&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;miro-copy-source--rte&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own a named account territory or portfolio&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enterprise: &lt;/strong&gt;Pursue net-new logos and grow existing footprint across a portfolio of 3,000–15,000 EE organisations, with a disciplined outbound motion running in parallel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic: &lt;/strong&gt;Develop and execute deep account strategies across 3–10 global enterprise customers. Identify priority business initiatives, executive buyers, Champions, competitive risks, and multi-product expansion opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run complex, multi-threaded sales cycles&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Orchestrate discovery across Lines of Business, IT, and executive leadership. Map stakeholders, build champions, and create irrefutable business cases tied to named customer initiatives and measurable outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive workflow-led expansion&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Position Miro around high-value enterprise workflows — product strategy, roadmapping, customer discovery, prototyping, planning, agile execution, technical diagramming, portfolio visibility, and innovation governance. Connect Miro&#39;s platform to measurable customer outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build executive alignment and business cases&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage senior leaders across Product, Engineering, Design, IT, Transformation, Finance, and the C-suite. Create compelling business cases that tie Miro to named customer initiatives, quantified pain, strategic priorities, and long-term value realisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Orchestrate your POD to win&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cross-functional teams across Solution Engineering, Customer Success, Value Advisory, Professional Services, Product, Marketing, Partners, and executive sponsors. Align the team around clear account objectives, executive engagement plans, and expansion plays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create and manage strategic pipeline&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a disciplined pipeline generation motion using account-based execution, executive outreach, customer workshops, field marketing, partner collaboration, and renewal planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operate with rigorous sales discipline&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply MEDDPICC and Command of the Message at an expert level. Build customer-validated problem statements, develop real Champions, secure Economic Buyer access, quantify business impact, and use mutual plans to drive complex opportunities forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Forecast with precision and raise the bar&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage leading indicators to stay ahead of coverage requirements, communicate risks early, contribute deal learnings, and mentor peers on territory planning, stakeholder mapping, and value selling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;miro-copy-source--rte&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;miro-copy-source--rte&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;miro-copy-source--rte&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For both Enterprise and Strategic AE:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;Expert-level MEDDPICC command — fluent across complex multi-stakeholder deals; coaches others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;Strong executive presence — credibly engages Director, VP, and C-level across technical and business personas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;Deep account planning discipline, with the ability to translate customer strategy into named initiatives, stakeholder maps, pipeline plans, and measurable expansion outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;Experience orchestrating cross-functional deal teams across SE, CS, Services, Value Advisory, Product, Marketing, Partners, and executive sponsors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;AI fluency and curiosity — leverages AI tools to improve account research, stakeholder mapping, territory strategy, opportunity planning, and overall sales productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;Comfort operating in complex, ambiguous enterprise environments where success requires persistence, business acumen, and the ability to create belief with both customers and internal teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For Enterprise AE:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;5+ years of B2B SaaS sales with meaningful tenure on enterprise accounts of 3,000+ employees.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;Proven $50k–$100k+ ARR closes with 3–12 month cycles in complex, multi-product sales environments; demonstrated formal business cases and ROI models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;Disciplined outbound habit — dedicates consistent weekly time to pipeline generation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For Strategic AE:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;10+ years of SaaS sales experience, including significant experience selling to Fortune 500 / Global 2000 enterprises with 10,000+ employees.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;Proven success owning a small number of named strategic accounts and driving complex expansion motions across multiple business units, geographies, personas, and executive stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;Track record closing and expanding $250K–$1M+ enterprise opportunities, ideally including multi-product, multi-year, or transformation-oriented deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s in it for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We want you to feel supported, connected, and ready to grow. Our global benefits package generally includes equity, a wellbeing benefit, a WFH equipment allowance, and an annual Learning &amp;amp; Development stipend. Join a diverse team where you can do your best work. Full benefits may differ per location. If you would like to learn more about location-specific benefits, please refer to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://miro.com/app/board/uXjVG8Fi8Yc=/?moveToWidget=3458764661021134968&amp;amp;cot=10&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Global Miro benefits board&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Miro&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Miro is a visual workspace for innovation that enables distributed teams of any size to build the next big thing. The platform&#39;s infinite canvas enables teams to lead engaging workshops and meetings, design products, brainstorm ideas, and more. Miro, co-headquartered in San Francisco and Amsterdam, serves more than 100M users and 250,000 companies collaborate in the Innovation Workspace. Miro was founded in 2011 and currently has more than 1,600 employees in 13 hubs around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;We are a team of dreamers. We look for individuals who dream big, work hard, and above all stay humble. Collaboration is at the heart of what we do and through our work together we hope to create a supportive, welcoming, and innovative environment. We strive to play as a team to win the world and create a better version of ourselves every day. If this sounds like something that excites you, we want to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Check out more about life at Miro:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Youtube:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@lifeatmiro&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@lifeatmiro&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;https://www.youtube.com/@lifeatmiro&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Blog:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://miro.com/careers/life-at-miro/all/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://miro.com/careers/life-at-miro/all/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;https://miro.com/careers/life-at-miro/all/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Instagram: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/mirohq/&quot;&gt;https://www.instagram.com/mirohq/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Miro, we strive to create and foster an environment of belonging and collaboration across cultural differences.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Miro’s mission — &lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Empower teams to create the next big thing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; — is how we think about our product, people, and culture. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We believe that creating big things requires diverse and inclusive teams. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Diversity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; invites all talent with different demography, identities and styles &lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;to step in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;, and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; invites them to step &lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;closer together. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, we are working to build a more diverse Miro, cultivate a sense of belonging for future and current Mironeers around the world, and foster an environment where everyone can collaborate and embrace differences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Miro handles and uses personal data of job applicants in line with its &lt;a href=&quot;https://miro.com/legal/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt; found &lt;a href=&quot;https://miro.com/legal/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re always excited to connect with strong talent for this team. While this Expression of Interest pipeline is focused on future opportunities, some related openings may also be live today.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;re looking to make a move immediately, we encourage you to check our careers page for currently open roles that match your background.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By applying here, you&#39;re joining our talent community for this specific team. Here is exactly how we handle these applications:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We look at every profile: &lt;/strong&gt;Our recruiting team reviews these regularly. If your background aligns with the skills we know we&#39;ll need next, we&#39;ll flag your profile.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We start with a casual chat: &lt;/strong&gt;If there&#39;s a potential future match, a recruiter will reach out for an introductory conversation. No intense interview loops—just a chance to connect on your career goals and what we&#39;re building.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We respect your time: &lt;/strong&gt;We won&#39;t kick off a formal, multi-stage interview process until a role is officially open and approved.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We keep you in mind: &lt;/strong&gt;Even if we don&#39;t reach out right away, we keep this talent pool active and turn to it first when a new headcount opens up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;miro-copy-source--rte&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;miro-copy-source--rte&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our SMB and Commercial teams sit at the core of Miro&#39;s new business engine. SMB AEs work with small and scaling businesses — companies between 1 and 500 employees — in a fast-paced, high-volume environment where momentum matters. Commercial AEs work with mid-market companies from 500 to 3,000 employees — large enough to demand a real evaluation process, agile enough that the right champion can move a deal in weeks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Together, these teams represent the full spectrum from high-velocity transactional selling to increasingly rigorous, multi-stakeholder deals. If you&#39;re a strong SMB closer looking to level up, or a mid-market seller who thrives on volume and strategy in equal measure, this is where you belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sc-kWREmZ gtHHTF&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sc-fxtexz gAAGsB&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;miro-copy-source--rte&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;miro-copy-source--rte&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Both roles own the full sales cycle — from first conversation to closed deal — across a mix of inbound leads, outbound prospecting, and existing account expansion. The core motion is the same: generate pipeline, run disciplined discovery, connect Miro&#39;s platform to business outcomes, and close. The segment and deal complexity differ, but the fundamentals are shared.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SMB AEs manage a high-volume book of 1–500 EE prospects with fast cycles and direct decision-makers. Commercial AEs balance a similar volume with deeper, multi-stakeholder deals requiring formal business cases and director-to-C-suite engagement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;miro-copy-source--rte&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;miro-copy-source--rte&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the full sales cycle&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prospecting and discovery through to demo, negotiation, and close across your territory — high-volume for SMB, a blend of volume and depth for Commercial.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive net-new logo acquisition&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute a territory strategy to land new accounts in your segment, owning every stage from outbound prospecting to signed contract.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Generate and maintain pipeline&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strike the right balance between managing inbound leads and generating outbound pipeline. Keep a healthy, well-forecasted pipeline at all times.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run value-first discovery&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply MEDDPICC and Command of the Message to uncover genuine pain, connect Miro&#39;s platform to business outcomes, and build a clear case for change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Execute a hybrid motion&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pursue net-new logos while identifying expansion signals within existing accounts. Understand when to go wide and when to go deep.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engage decision-makers at the right level&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SMB: &lt;/strong&gt;Work directly with founders, ops leads, and team managers to identify pain and close quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial: &lt;/strong&gt;Adapt your style from LOB champion to VP/C-suite in the same deal cycle. Build relationships with economic buyers and communicate Miro&#39;s value in terms of business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Forecast with accuracy&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain CRM hygiene in Salesforce, manage your pipeline with discipline, and commit to numbers you can stand behind.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate across your POD&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in lockstep with Renewals, Customer Success, Marketing, and — for Commercial — Solution Engineering and Value Advisory, to ensure a joined-up customer experience at every stage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;miro-copy-source--rte&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;miro-copy-source--rte&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For both SMB and Commercial AE:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;Working knowledge of MEDDPICC and Command of the Message, applied consistently with a drive to sharpen both.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;A high-velocity mindset — comfortable running many deals simultaneously with the discipline to prioritise and focus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;Strong prioritisation and adaptability — able to balance inbound demand, outbound prospecting, and expansion opportunities effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;Resilience and coachability — you treat lost deals as learning and apply feedback fast.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;Proficiency with Salesforce for pipeline management, plus Outreach (or similar) and Gong.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;AI fluency and curiosity — comfortable leveraging AI tools to improve prospect research, outreach preparation, account planning, and productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For SMB AE:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;1–4 years in a SaaS or B2B tech sales environment, including at least some full-cycle closing experience or a strong SDR background.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For Commercial AE:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;2–5 years of full-cycle B2B SaaS closing experience, with 1–2 years focused on mid-market (500–3,000 EE).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;Confident MEDDPICC practitioner — applied habitually, not just when deals get complicated.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;Proven ability to manage high deal volume while going deeper on strategic opportunities simultaneously, ideally in a multi-product sales environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;Strong executive communication — adapts style from LOB champion to VP/C-suite in the same deal cycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s in it for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We want you to feel supported, connected, and ready to grow. Our global benefits package generally includes equity, a wellbeing benefit, a WFH equipment allowance, and an annual Learning &amp;amp; Development stipend. Join a diverse team where you can do your best work. Full benefits may differ per location. If you would like to learn more about location-specific benefits, please refer to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://miro.com/app/board/uXjVG8Fi8Yc=/?moveToWidget=3458764661021134968&amp;amp;cot=10&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Global Miro benefits board&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Miro&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Miro is a visual workspace for innovation that enables distributed teams of any size to build the next big thing. The platform&#39;s infinite canvas enables teams to lead engaging workshops and meetings, design products, brainstorm ideas, and more. Miro, co-headquartered in San Francisco and Amsterdam, serves more than 100M users and 250,000 companies collaborate in the Innovation Workspace. Miro was founded in 2011 and currently has more than 1,600 employees in 13 hubs around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;We are a team of dreamers. We look for individuals who dream big, work hard, and above all stay humble. Collaboration is at the heart of what we do and through our work together we hope to create a supportive, welcoming, and innovative environment. We strive to play as a team to win the world and create a better version of ourselves every day. If this sounds like something that excites you, we want to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Check out more about life at Miro:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Youtube:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@lifeatmiro&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@lifeatmiro&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;https://www.youtube.com/@lifeatmiro&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Blog:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://miro.com/careers/life-at-miro/all/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://miro.com/careers/life-at-miro/all/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;https://miro.com/careers/life-at-miro/all/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Instagram: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/mirohq/&quot;&gt;https://www.instagram.com/mirohq/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Miro, we strive to create and foster an environment of belonging and collaboration across cultural differences.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Miro’s mission — &lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Empower teams to create the next big thing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; — is how we think about our product, people, and culture. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We believe that creating big things requires diverse and inclusive teams. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Diversity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; invites all talent with different demography, identities and styles &lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;to step in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;, and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; invites them to step &lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;closer together. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, we are working to build a more diverse Miro, cultivate a sense of belonging for future and current Mironeers around the world, and foster an environment where everyone can collaborate and embrace differences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Miro handles and uses personal data of job applicants in line with its &lt;a href=&quot;https://miro.com/legal/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt; found &lt;a href=&quot;https://miro.com/legal/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re always excited to connect with strong talent for this team. While this Expression of Interest pipeline is focused on future opportunities, some related openings may also be live today.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;re looking to make a move immediately, we encourage you to check our careers page for currently open roles that match your background.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By applying here, you&#39;re joining our talent community for this specific team. Here is exactly how we handle these applications:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We look at every profile: &lt;/strong&gt;Our recruiting team reviews these regularly. If your background aligns with the skills we know we&#39;ll need next, we&#39;ll flag your profile.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We start with a casual chat: &lt;/strong&gt;If there&#39;s a potential future match, a recruiter will reach out for an introductory conversation. No intense interview loops—just a chance to connect on your career goals and what we&#39;re building.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We respect your time: &lt;/strong&gt;We won&#39;t kick off a formal, multi-stage interview process until a role is officially open and approved.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We keep you in mind: &lt;/strong&gt;Even if we don&#39;t reach out right away, we keep this talent pool active and turn to it first when a new headcount opens up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;miro-copy-source--rte&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;miro-copy-source--rte&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our SMB and Commercial teams sit at the core of Miro&#39;s new business engine. SMB AEs work with small and scaling businesses — companies between 1 and 500 employees — in a fast-paced, high-volume environment where momentum matters. Commercial AEs work with mid-market companies from 500 to 3,000 employees — large enough to demand a real evaluation process, agile enough that the right champion can move a deal in weeks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Together, these teams represent the full spectrum from high-velocity transactional selling to increasingly rigorous, multi-stakeholder deals. If you&#39;re a strong SMB closer looking to level up, or a mid-market seller who thrives on volume and strategy in equal measure, this is where you belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sc-kWREmZ gtHHTF&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sc-fxtexz gAAGsB&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;miro-copy-source--rte&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;miro-copy-source--rte&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Both roles own the full sales cycle — from first conversation to closed deal — across a mix of inbound leads, outbound prospecting, and existing account expansion. The core motion is the same: generate pipeline, run disciplined discovery, connect Miro&#39;s platform to business outcomes, and close. The segment and deal complexity differ, but the fundamentals are shared.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SMB AEs manage a high-volume book of 1–500 EE prospects with fast cycles and direct decision-makers. Commercial AEs balance a similar volume with deeper, multi-stakeholder deals requiring formal business cases and director-to-C-suite engagement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;miro-copy-source--rte&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;miro-copy-source--rte&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the full sales cycle&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prospecting and discovery through to demo, negotiation, and close across your territory — high-volume for SMB, a blend of volume and depth for Commercial.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive net-new logo acquisition&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute a territory strategy to land new accounts in your segment, owning every stage from outbound prospecting to signed contract.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Generate and maintain pipeline&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strike the right balance between managing inbound leads and generating outbound pipeline. Keep a healthy, well-forecasted pipeline at all times.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run value-first discovery&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply MEDDPICC and Command of the Message to uncover genuine pain, connect Miro&#39;s platform to business outcomes, and build a clear case for change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Execute a hybrid motion&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pursue net-new logos while identifying expansion signals within existing accounts. Understand when to go wide and when to go deep.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engage decision-makers at the right level&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SMB: &lt;/strong&gt;Work directly with founders, ops leads, and team managers to identify pain and close quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial: &lt;/strong&gt;Adapt your style from LOB champion to VP/C-suite in the same deal cycle. Build relationships with economic buyers and communicate Miro&#39;s value in terms of business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Forecast with accuracy&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain CRM hygiene in Salesforce, manage your pipeline with discipline, and commit to numbers you can stand behind.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate across your POD&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in lockstep with Renewals, Customer Success, Marketing, and — for Commercial — Solution Engineering and Value Advisory, to ensure a joined-up customer experience at every stage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;miro-copy-source--rte&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;miro-copy-source--rte&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For both SMB and Commercial AE:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;Working knowledge of MEDDPICC and Command of the Message, applied consistently with a drive to sharpen both.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;A high-velocity mindset — comfortable running many deals simultaneously with the discipline to prioritise and focus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;Strong prioritisation and adaptability — able to balance inbound demand, outbound prospecting, and expansion opportunities effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;Resilience and coachability — you treat lost deals as learning and apply feedback fast.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;Proficiency with Salesforce for pipeline management, plus Outreach (or similar) and Gong.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;AI fluency and curiosity — comfortable leveraging AI tools to improve prospect research, outreach preparation, account planning, and productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For SMB AE:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;1–4 years in a SaaS or B2B tech sales environment, including at least some full-cycle closing experience or a strong SDR background.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For Commercial AE:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;2–5 years of full-cycle B2B SaaS closing experience, with 1–2 years focused on mid-market (500–3,000 EE).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;Confident MEDDPICC practitioner — applied habitually, not just when deals get complicated.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;Proven ability to manage high deal volume while going deeper on strategic opportunities simultaneously, ideally in a multi-product sales environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;Strong executive communication — adapts style from LOB champion to VP/C-suite in the same deal cycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
