&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Miro handles and uses personal data of job applicants in line with its &lt;a href=&quot;https://miro.com/legal/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt; found &lt;a href=&quot;https://miro.com/legal/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sc-eucuRR eZyTkX&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sc-cYWyaL hpCUnt&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;The Professional Services organization at Miro is focused on ensuring our Enterprise customers achieve exceptional outcomes through the Innovation Workspace. Our team of strategic advisors, implementation experts, and forward deployed consultants work side-by-side with customers to transform how they collaborate, build, and innovate—powered by agentic AI and Miro&#39;s world-class platform.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sc-eucuRR eZyTkX&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sc-cmZgWc lnEiAS&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div&gt;As a Forward Deployed Consultant, Manufacturing, you will apply AI solutions to transform and automate the core operating processes of leading industrial enterprises. You will engage directly with C-level executives, help them identify high-impact opportunities, build and test enterprise-grade AI solutions on their own data and systems, and drive measurable business outcomes.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;This role sits at the intersection of strategy, operations, and technology. You will be paired with an Account Executive against named accounts—hunting for problems worth solving, then proving they can be solved. Generalist FDCs lead client discussions across industries; as the Manufacturing Specialist, you are the dedicated depth they bring in when a pursuit turns on industrial expertise.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;E&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;xecutive Agenda:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with senior executives—COO, Chief Supply Chain Officer, Chief Digital Officer, VP Manufacturing, VP Quality—to define an AI transformation agenda Miro can attach to&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the initial CxO conversation that creates awareness of what AI makes possible for the business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Qualify opportunities before committing to a Validation Sprint: sponsor authority, commitment, and the account&#39;s potential to become a multi-year, seven-figure relationship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Validation Sprints:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-author the Sprint charter with the AE: the business problem, its value, our approach, exit criteria, and the partnership proposal that follows success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run the Sprint end to end—immerse, prioritise, build, read out—developing and testing the solution on the customer&#39;s real data and systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take manufacturing processes apart and rebuild them on AI-first principles across five workflows: new product development and gate review, quality and continuous improvement, portfolio and program management, operations and launch readiness, and process development and transformation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build using Miro&#39;s AI Workflows, Prototypes, and Goals, Roadmaps &amp;amp; Delivery capabilities, extended through Miro&#39;s API, WebSDK, and MCP integrations into ERP, PLM, MES, and quality systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Value and Conversion:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn Sprint outcomes into a business value story, ROI model, and KPI baseline—grounded in metrics the customer already runs on: gate cycle time, requirement coverage at gate, defect recurrence, cost of poor quality, capacity utilisation, on-time launch rate, ramp-to-full-rate time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support executive leadership in delivering the Value Story read-out to the sponsor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-own with the AE the conversion of Sprint outcomes into the partnership proposal and commercial approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the scope of Professional Services involvement post-sale and hand over cleanly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Package what you learn and radiate it—internally to Sales, Marketing, and Product, and externally through thought leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;top-tier consulting, forward deployed engineering, solution consulting, or enterprise transformation&lt;/strong&gt;, weighted toward manufacturing and industrial environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;manufacturing operating processes&lt;/strong&gt;: NPI and stage-gate/APQP, engineering change management, quality systems (FMEA, 8D, PPAP), S&amp;amp;OP and production planning, lean and continuous improvement, maintenance and reliability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency with the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;industrial enterprise stack&lt;/strong&gt;—ERP (SAP or equivalent), PLM (Teamcenter, Windchill, 3DEXPERIENCE), MES, quality management systems—and where the data lives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Credibility with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;COO, Chief Supply Chain Officer, VP Operations, VP Quality&lt;/strong&gt;, and Plant General Manager stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;GenAI&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;skills: Miro, Cursor, Claude Code and Cowork, ChatGPT, Google and Microsoft suites,&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;MCP&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;integrations, prompt and context engineering. You can&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;build working solutions yourself&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;and orchestrate an AI Engineer when the build demands it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to build a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;before/after value story&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;with financial and ROI analysis that survives finance scrutiny&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;business-problem-first&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;rather than product-first mindset, and the curiosity to take any process apart&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort in both the boardroom and the plant&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-starter who operates independently and under ambiguity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing to&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;travel&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to customer sites up to 40%&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s in it for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We want you to feel supported, connected, and ready to grow. Our global benefits package generally includes equity, a wellbeing benefit, a WFH equipment allowance, and an annual Learning &amp;amp; Development stipend. Join a diverse team where you can do your best work. Full benefits may differ per location. If you would like to learn more about location-specific benefits, please refer to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://miro.com/app/board/uXjVG8Fi8Yc=/?moveToWidget=3458764661021134968&amp;amp;cot=10&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Global Miro benefits board&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: #f9f6f0;&quot;&gt;#LI-LW1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Miro&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Miro is a visual workspace for innovation that enables distributed teams of any size to build the next big thing. The platform&#39;s infinite canvas enables teams to lead engaging workshops and meetings, design products, brainstorm ideas, and more. Miro, co-headquartered in San Francisco and Amsterdam, serves more than 100M users and 250,000 companies collaborate in the Innovation Workspace. Miro was founded in 2011 and currently has more than 1,600 employees in 13 hubs around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;We are a team of dreamers. We look for individuals who dream big, work hard, and above all stay humble. Collaboration is at the heart of what we do and through our work together we hope to create a supportive, welcoming, and innovative environment. We strive to play as a team to win the world and create a better version of ourselves every day. If this sounds like something that excites you, we want to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Check out more about life at Miro:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Youtube:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@lifeatmiro&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@lifeatmiro&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;https://www.youtube.com/@lifeatmiro&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
