&lt;div&gt;The Customer Success Management team (CSM) is part of Customer Experience, which also includes Renewals and Support teams. CSM works with our Enterprise-licensed customers to help them collaborate and innovate with Miro continuously, resulting in high retention and expansion rates.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
