&lt;li&gt;Recommend ways to streamline tool usage and enhance collaboration strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide guidance on Agile ways of working and help teams integrate Agile principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share best practices and coach teams on improving their workflows with Miro.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
