&lt;div class=&quot;sc-cYWyaL hpCUnt&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Miro’s GTM Enablement Team exists to make our go-to-market teams measurably better at their jobs. Our work covers onboarding, skill development, manager coaching, certification, and the AI tooling that increasingly powers all of it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sc-eucuRR eZyTkX&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sc-cmZgWc lnEiAS&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
