&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sc-eucuRR eZyTkX&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sc-cYWyaL hpCUnt&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;As Principal, Field Excellence you will be the standard-bearer for how Miro creates, converts, and closes pipeline globally. You&#39;ll clarify the standards -- what’s required for pipeline generation, what good discovery sounds like, what qualification rigor means at each stage, what a deal has to demonstrate before it advances -- and then build the systems that make those standards real in the field. This is a global role covering every Sales segment and region.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is an individual contributor role reporting to the Head of GTM Enablement, working directly with regional Sales VPs and the CRO.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sc-eucuRR eZyTkX&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sc-cmZgWc lnEiAS&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own Miro’s Sales Excellence program, helping reps run Miro&#39;s sales methodology end to end, including pipeline generation, creating problem statements, value articulation, running executive-level meetings, and accomplishing stage exit criteria to standard&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the resident expert in MEDDPICC and Command of the Message, consistently driving adoption through our field teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Codify what top performers actually do, using call data, win/loss analysis, and field observation, then turn it into standards the rest of the organization can execute, up-leveling the selling skills of every Miro seller&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the behavioral rubrics and scoring criteria used by Miro&#39;s AI call-scoring and coaching-signal systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with regional Sales leaders to embed coaching and inspection of critical sales skills into team cadences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prove impact through measurable changes in rep behavior, methodology adherence, pipeline generation, sales velocity, and win rates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years selling experience and 3+ years sales management and sales enablement experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A record of driving adoption at a regional or global scale - owning a program/initiative, driving a behavioral change, and reinforcing adoption&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working directly in call data, win/loss, and pipeline analytics&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear understanding of key performance metrics for GTM orgs&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep working knowledge of at least one enterprise sales methodology (MEDDPICC or Command of the Message)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency with AI and experience using it to make sales teams more efficient and effective&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to influence and partner with senior Sales leaders to drive pipeline and closed-won revenue&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong facilitation skills in front of experienced sellers and managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
